  "answer_text": "The method achieving the lowest hallucination rate within each paper is as follows:\n\n1.  **Chain-of-thought prompting** in the study on LawFactQA, with a hallucination rate of 9.4% [S001, 1023-2239].\n2.  **Fine-tuned model** in the study on PopCultureQA, with a hallucination rate of 9.8% [S006, 1367-2401].\n3.  **RAG without reranking** in the study on TriviaCheck, with a hallucination rate of 23.1% [S010, 957-2287].\n4.  **Condition R** (retrieval-augmented) in the study on SciFactBench, with a hallucination rate of 6.3% [S008, 1995-3427].\n5.  **Condition R** (retrieval-augmented) in the study comparing conditions B and R, with a hallucination rate of 16.3% [S018, 2606-3739].",
